# Normalize every text file to LF in the index and in the working tree.
# `text=auto` lets Git detect which files are text; `eol=lf` makes the
# checkout LF too, so a tool that reads a working copy and writes it back
# cannot reintroduce CRLF on a platform whose default is otherwise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# GitHub's language bar leaves prose out by default, so this repository read
# as Python, its tooling, though templates are its content and outweigh the
# tooling about nine to one. Counting Markdown names it for what it ships.
*.md linguist-detectable
